{"task_id": "HumanEval/47", "solution": "def median(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return median of elements in the list l.\n    Calculates median based on statistical rules, handling odd/even counts and return types.\n    \"\"\"\n    sorted_l = sorted(l)\n    n = len(sorted_l)\n    if n % 2 == 1:\n        # Odd number of elements\n        return sorted_l[n // 2]\n    else:\n        # Even number of elements\n        mid1 = sorted_l[n // 2 - 1]\n        mid2 = sorted_l[n // 2]\n        return (mid1 + mid2) / 2.0"}
